WEBVTT

00:00:01.220 --> 00:00:02.730
Mika is alive.

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:07.230
When we fought against the vampires in Shinjuku,

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:12.610
I was reunited with Mika,
 but he had become a vampire.

00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:16.420
I couldn't bring him back,

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:17.870
but he's alive.

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:19.120
For now, that's enough.

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:22.220
Mika,

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:24.120
I <i>will</i> save you.

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:48.400
Run!

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:50.960
The vampires are here!

00:00:57.220 --> 00:00:59.440
No! Let me go!

00:00:59.440 --> 00:01:02.410
Don't worry, I won't kill you.

00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:06.670
Though I should at least have a taste, right?

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:08.920
N-No!

00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:10.920
Stop it!

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:23.520
You're not taking them on my watch, Vampire!

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:25.770
Damn human, how dare you!

00:01:30.120 --> 00:01:31.730
Go, Gekkouin!

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:41.050
Why you!

00:01:43.410 --> 00:01:45.770
It's about time you took us seriously!

00:01:47.520 --> 00:01:49.330
We'll save your family, too.

00:01:51.170 --> 00:01:53.840
Stop playing the hero and pay attention, you idiot!

00:01:55.060 --> 00:01:57.590
Don't get cocky, humans!

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:06.230
Hello there, now you owe us one.

00:02:06.230 --> 00:02:09.030
Thank you, Shinoa, Mitsuba.

00:02:09.030 --> 00:02:11.290
You should apologize, idiot!

00:02:11.290 --> 00:02:12.690
Don't break formation!

00:02:13.060 --> 00:02:14.080
Huh?

00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:15.800
But come on Mitsuba,

00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:17.990
they were attacking that family.

00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:20.240
What if I hadn't gotten there in time?

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:22.470
Then you should rescue them quickly!

00:02:22.470 --> 00:02:24.630
Yuu-kun, Kimizuki-kun!

00:02:24.630 --> 00:02:25.640
Are you okay?

00:02:25.640 --> 00:02:27.540
Yeah, we're fine.

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:29.960
I'm not done!

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:31.960
Well now,

00:02:31.960 --> 00:02:36.460
I see you guys are taking it as easy as ever.

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:37.450
Guren?

00:02:37.450 --> 00:02:40.800
I-I'm really sorry, Lieutenant Colonel Guren!

00:02:41.970 --> 00:02:43.220
Though truth be told,

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:46.220
you did a good job protecting that family.

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:48.630
What do you mean by that?

00:02:48.630 --> 00:02:50.320
In case you didn't notice,

00:02:50.320 --> 00:02:52.790
The mission here is finished.

00:02:52.790 --> 00:02:57.490
Well, I'm just happy to have my work finished for me so quickly.

00:02:57.490 --> 00:03:01.490
So happy, in fact, that I already have another mission for you.

00:03:01.760 --> 00:03:03.510
Can you do it?

00:03:03.510 --> 00:03:05.990
Yeah, leave it to us.

00:03:13.120 --> 00:03:14.750
Then without further ado,

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:18.710
I'll now go over the mission details.

00:03:18.710 --> 00:03:23.130
To think we were fighting the
 vampires in Shinjuku just yesterday...

00:03:23.130 --> 00:03:26.260
Lieutenant Colonel Guren is quite a slave driver, wouldn't you say?

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:28.100
Whatever.

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:30.550
Just get to the briefing.

00:03:30.550 --> 00:03:32.330
Yeah, yeah.

00:03:32.330 --> 00:03:35.520
Well, it's actually a pretty simple mission.

00:03:35.830 --> 00:03:38.590
We're to attack a vampire base,

00:03:38.590 --> 00:03:43.440
and rescue a young girl,
 named Riko-chan, who was taken.

00:03:43.440 --> 00:03:46.530
The vampires took a child?

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:48.760
There's nothing strange about that.

00:03:48.760 --> 00:03:54.600
Child or not, it doesn't matter,
 kidnapping people is normal for them.

00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:57.800
Still, there is one thing that I'm curious about.

00:03:57.800 --> 00:04:00.660
According to Riko-chan's mother,

00:04:00.660 --> 00:04:06.600
it was a squad of vampires that attacked them.

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:08.810
Then, strangely, another vampire appeared,

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:14.560
wiped out the entire squad and took Riko-chan for himself.

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:17.620
A vampire attacked its own?

00:04:17.620 --> 00:04:19.630
That is a bit weird.

00:04:19.630 --> 00:04:22.600
I wonder if there's some reason behind it.

00:04:22.600 --> 00:04:24.820
Who cares about the reason?

00:04:25.760 --> 00:04:29.080
Tearing a family apart is unforgivable.

00:04:29.730 --> 00:04:30.870
Yuu-san...

00:04:56.210 --> 00:04:56.980
Lana,

00:04:57.530 --> 00:04:59.360
have you been a good girl?

00:05:00.840 --> 00:05:02.830
How many times do I have to tell you,

00:05:02.830 --> 00:05:04.650
my name is Riko!

00:05:04.650 --> 00:05:06.630
It's not Lana!

00:05:06.630 --> 00:05:09.370
Come now, Lana, what are you talking about?

00:05:09.650 --> 00:05:11.880
Oh, I know.

00:05:11.880 --> 00:05:14.870
You want a hairpin to match your clothes, don't you?

00:05:15.200 --> 00:05:18.420
Just wait, I'll get you one.

00:05:19.880 --> 00:05:23.240
I don't need that! Just let me leave!

00:05:23.240 --> 00:05:25.550
What are you saying, Lana?

00:05:26.430 --> 00:05:29.010
This is where you and I live.

00:05:32.320 --> 00:05:33.440
Lana?

00:05:33.440 --> 00:05:34.770
What's wrong?

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:37.230
No! Stay away!

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:48.280
Just like I thought. It looks great on you.

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:57.790
Lana, my lovely little sister.

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:02.800
So she's your new doll?

00:06:03.330 --> 00:06:06.400
Ferid Bathory? Crowley Eusford?

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:09.670
Ah, no respect for nobles?

00:06:09.670 --> 00:06:12.310
You must not be interested in living very long, Shahar-kun.

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:14.310
Who are you?

00:06:14.310 --> 00:06:16.060
Why are you here!?

00:06:16.420 --> 00:06:20.190
I wasn't really interested, you know.

00:06:20.190 --> 00:06:23.830
Ferid-kun insisted I just had to come.

00:06:25.240 --> 00:06:29.030
As it happens, I heard an interesting rumor.

00:06:32.520 --> 00:06:38.080
Apparently, someone in the
 area has been stealing livestock.

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:43.340
Is her blood so tasty that you would lower yourself to thievery for it?

00:06:43.340 --> 00:06:46.340
D-Don't you dare touch Lana!

00:06:50.770 --> 00:06:51.590
No!

00:06:52.070 --> 00:06:55.200
Just let me have a little taste.

00:06:55.200 --> 00:06:56.220
No!

00:07:08.080 --> 00:07:10.740
Oh my, you took her away.

00:07:12.470 --> 00:07:15.740
Did you remember something from your past, perhaps?

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:17.570
No...

00:07:17.570 --> 00:07:20.030
I didn't...

00:07:20.030 --> 00:07:21.370
I...

00:07:23.860 --> 00:07:27.380
I swear Ferid-kun, you always were a bully.

00:07:27.680 --> 00:07:32.480
If I remember, weren't you the one who turned him?

00:07:32.480 --> 00:07:33.680
Hm?

00:07:33.680 --> 00:07:37.890
Couldn't say, I don't bother remembering stuff from so long ago.

00:07:38.280 --> 00:07:40.910
Well, not like it matters.

00:07:40.910 --> 00:07:43.610
Was that all we came for?

00:07:43.610 --> 00:07:46.030
Nah, of course not.

00:07:46.030 --> 00:07:49.810
The important matter I had to 
attend to is something else entirely.

00:07:49.810 --> 00:07:51.510
Important matter?

00:07:52.550 --> 00:07:53.910
Not telling you.

00:07:54.260 --> 00:07:56.140
Anyway, let's be on our way.

00:07:59.440 --> 00:08:01.660
Let me warn you though,

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:05.820
if you don't get along with the
 rest you'll be in for some pain.

00:08:05.820 --> 00:08:12.800
Well, have fun playing house with your new doll.

00:08:15.570 --> 00:08:18.290
What that vampire said...

00:08:18.290 --> 00:08:19.680
Is it true?

00:08:20.050 --> 00:08:23.110
You used to be human?

00:08:24.280 --> 00:08:25.870
I'm sorry...

00:08:25.870 --> 00:08:27.960
I'm so sorry, Lana...

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:38.480
That's the vampire's hiding place?

00:08:38.480 --> 00:08:39.640
I think so,

00:08:39.640 --> 00:08:43.460
but we won't know for sure until we look inside.

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:49.300
To rescue Riko-chan, we'll have to deal with the vampire first.

00:08:49.300 --> 00:08:53.710
As such, we'll act at noon.

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:02.920
Lana...

00:09:06.650 --> 00:09:09.480
I won't let the bad guys have you...

00:09:10.630 --> 00:09:12.460
I won't let anyone have you...

00:09:16.650 --> 00:09:18.490
Please forgive me.

00:09:18.490 --> 00:09:20.170
I...

00:09:20.170 --> 00:09:21.870
Your blood,

00:09:22.280 --> 00:09:23.370
Lana...

00:09:29.010 --> 00:09:33.630
What that vampire said was true, wasn't it?

00:09:33.630 --> 00:09:36.120
Lana... Lana...

00:09:37.370 --> 00:09:39.640
We'll always be together.

00:09:51.460 --> 00:09:53.850
Based on the report,

00:09:53.850 --> 00:09:59.060
it sounds like it's just one vampire, 
but we don't know that for sure.

00:09:59.060 --> 00:10:03.540
It's possible there could be more, so be careful.

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:06.540
Now then, let's begin.

00:10:21.050 --> 00:10:23.060
Pretty big place.

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:25.480
It'd be preferable to split up and search the place,

00:10:25.480 --> 00:10:28.060
but we're not sure how many vampires there are.

00:10:28.060 --> 00:10:30.920
It'll take more time, but let's stick together.

00:10:30.920 --> 00:10:32.310
Who are you?

00:10:35.290 --> 00:10:36.860
Look, that girl...

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:40.150
Yes, she's probably the girl in the report.

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:47.580
Are you here to take Lana from me, too?

00:10:48.020 --> 00:10:49.080
Lana?

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:50.880
You can't have her!

00:10:51.600 --> 00:10:52.380
Yuu!

00:10:57.280 --> 00:10:59.100
Let's back him up!

00:11:03.510 --> 00:11:06.390
We've found you, traitor!

00:11:07.890 --> 00:11:09.800
Demon weapons?

00:11:09.800 --> 00:11:11.650
A vampire extermination squad.

00:11:12.330 --> 00:11:16.430
We have no business with you this time, get out of here!

00:11:16.430 --> 00:11:18.900
If you get in our way, we'll kill you too!

00:11:32.840 --> 00:11:34.510
Lana, let's go.

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:37.920
Let her go, vampire!

00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:44.050
Now, Lana!

00:11:50.900 --> 00:11:51.770
Yuu!

00:11:52.390 --> 00:11:54.010
She's in danger!

00:11:54.010 --> 00:11:57.400
We'll handle this, you go after her!

00:12:02.800 --> 00:12:03.760
Lana!

00:12:03.760 --> 00:12:05.030
Are you okay?

00:12:06.230 --> 00:12:07.450
Yeah.

00:12:07.850 --> 00:12:10.540
Our brothers are preoccupied with the humans.

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:12.790
We'll take care of Shahar on our own!

00:12:21.010 --> 00:12:22.480
Hide in here.

00:12:22.480 --> 00:12:24.840
What are you going to do?

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:28.400
I'll deal with all of them, vampires and humans.

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:31.600
To stay with you,

00:12:31.940 --> 00:12:33.310
I'll do anything.

00:12:35.770 --> 00:12:38.360
Be a good girl and wait here, Lana.

00:12:42.660 --> 00:12:44.610
Where did they go?

00:12:54.090 --> 00:12:56.610
Oh, great, you're okay.

00:12:56.610 --> 00:12:58.220
I'm here to save you.

00:12:58.220 --> 00:12:59.710
Save me?

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:00.760
Really?

00:13:00.760 --> 00:13:01.800
Yeah.

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:03.560
You're Riko, right?

00:13:03.560 --> 00:13:04.800
Yeah.

00:13:04.800 --> 00:13:06.010
Good.

00:13:06.570 --> 00:13:10.740
But why is he calling you Lana?

00:13:12.200 --> 00:13:16.430
He thinks I'm his little sister.

00:13:16.430 --> 00:13:19.470
I think Lana was her name.

00:13:20.560 --> 00:13:23.820
Why did you go with him?

00:13:24.320 --> 00:13:26.590
It looked like you did that willingly.

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:33.330
I thought that maybe I could help him.

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:34.680
Huh?

00:13:34.680 --> 00:13:35.970
What do you mean?

00:13:36.760 --> 00:13:41.340
I think he used to be human.

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:45.090
I felt so bad for him.

00:13:45.580 --> 00:13:47.500
He was apologizing...

00:13:48.400 --> 00:13:49.810
and crying.

00:13:51.990 --> 00:13:53.990
It was scary,

00:13:53.990 --> 00:13:56.600
but he was always so nice to me,

00:13:56.600 --> 00:13:59.360
so I...

00:14:03.310 --> 00:14:04.610
I see.

00:14:04.910 --> 00:14:06.700
You wait here.

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:08.710
My friends will be here soon.

00:14:10.370 --> 00:14:13.370
Are you going to kill him?

00:14:14.360 --> 00:14:16.620
I'm part of a vampire extermination squad.

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:20.880
I'm here to return you to your family.

00:14:24.480 --> 00:14:25.590
Die!

00:14:32.410 --> 00:14:35.240
I won't let anyone have Lana!

00:14:35.240 --> 00:14:39.540
I'll kill anyone who tries to steal her from me!

00:14:39.540 --> 00:14:41.650
That girl is not your sister!

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:44.650
Lana is my little sister!

00:14:45.080 --> 00:14:46.400
I won't let you have her!

00:14:47.680 --> 00:14:49.910
Maybe you used to be human...

00:14:49.910 --> 00:14:52.660
but right now you need to be stopped!

00:15:02.720 --> 00:15:03.920
That's all of them.

00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:07.920
Those vampires seemed strange.

00:15:08.310 --> 00:15:12.660
Yeah, seems like we've gotten mixed up in a pretty unusual situation.

00:15:12.660 --> 00:15:14.430
I'm worried about Yuu,

00:15:14.730 --> 00:15:16.430
let's go join up with him.

00:15:17.400 --> 00:15:20.310
Hey! Weren't you a human before?

00:15:20.960 --> 00:15:23.810
You hate the vampires and
 want them dead, don't you?

00:15:24.160 --> 00:15:25.320
Then—

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:28.840
I won't let you have Lana!

00:15:28.840 --> 00:15:29.520
I won't...

00:15:29.520 --> 00:15:30.600
Stop this!

00:15:30.600 --> 00:15:31.450
I don't—

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:34.700
Lana will never come home again.

00:15:35.090 --> 00:15:39.710
I couldn't bear it so I drank her blood.

00:15:41.280 --> 00:15:42.220
You...

00:15:42.220 --> 00:15:44.330
I'll kill anyone who tries to steal her away.

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:47.450
Anyone and everyone, I'll kill you all!

00:16:04.350 --> 00:16:05.840
Lana...

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:09.360
You won't take her...

00:16:11.360 --> 00:16:13.680
It's my fault.

00:16:13.680 --> 00:16:16.870
Lana, please forgive me.

00:16:25.370 --> 00:16:27.750
Damn it!

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:29.380
Wait!

00:16:48.370 --> 00:16:49.150
Lana!

00:16:49.720 --> 00:16:51.400
Lana! Lana!

00:16:54.400 --> 00:16:57.100
Lana, I'm so sorry!

00:16:57.100 --> 00:16:58.360
I...

00:16:58.360 --> 00:17:00.410
Again, I...

00:17:02.220 --> 00:17:04.000
I'm...

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:05.970
okay...

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:11.430
Lana... Lana...

00:17:13.230 --> 00:17:14.930
You...

00:17:15.720 --> 00:17:20.210
really are human.

00:17:20.210 --> 00:17:23.760
Vampires don't cry.

00:17:25.340 --> 00:17:26.940
I see.

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:28.440
I'm...

00:17:28.440 --> 00:17:29.880
human.

00:17:31.380 --> 00:17:33.190
I have a request.

00:17:35.400 --> 00:17:37.780
While I'm still human,

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:42.190
send me to where Lana is.

00:17:43.440 --> 00:17:44.580
Please.

00:17:47.880 --> 00:17:49.000
I understand.

00:17:56.300 --> 00:17:57.610
Yuu!

00:18:11.190 --> 00:18:14.190
I'm sorry I kept you waiting, Lana.

00:18:59.790 --> 00:19:04.740
Apparently they've taken Riko-chan
 and her mother in at the Shibuya base.

00:19:05.760 --> 00:19:07.280
I see.

00:19:07.280 --> 00:19:09.500
She gets to live with her family, then.

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:10.750
Yes.

00:19:11.100 --> 00:19:13.910
Now that we've finished scouting the place,

00:19:13.910 --> 00:19:17.250
let's meet up with Kimizuki-san and the others.

00:19:17.250 --> 00:19:19.630
Yeah, sure.

00:19:22.440 --> 00:19:26.140
Riko-chan told me about that vampire.

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:28.580
Unfortunately,

00:19:28.580 --> 00:19:33.120
we still have no way to cure
 people once they've been turned.

00:19:33.120 --> 00:19:35.110
Yuu-san, your judgement this time—

00:19:35.110 --> 00:19:36.960
I know.

00:19:36.960 --> 00:19:40.340
My job is to kill vampires.

00:19:40.340 --> 00:19:42.410
And we managed to save her.

00:19:44.040 --> 00:19:45.660
You're right.

00:19:45.660 --> 00:19:48.000
But if you're feeling down,

00:19:48.000 --> 00:19:51.140
you're free to cry into my chest.

00:19:51.140 --> 00:19:54.940
Let the lovely angel
 Shinoa-chan take your pain away!

00:19:54.940 --> 00:19:56.110
What?

00:19:56.110 --> 00:19:57.420
There you go again.

00:19:59.430 --> 00:20:01.760
Hurry up.

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:04.370
Get in the car already or we'll leave you behind.

00:20:04.370 --> 00:20:06.720
Damn you, Kimizuki!

00:20:08.050 --> 00:20:10.250
I heard all about it.

00:20:11.120 --> 00:20:13.950
Quit moping.

00:20:13.950 --> 00:20:17.800
You have family to save, don't you?

00:20:17.800 --> 00:20:20.620
You don't have time for that.

00:20:22.520 --> 00:20:23.950
Yeah.

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:26.000
Yuu-kun, hurry!

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:27.960
What are you sitting around for?

00:20:27.960 --> 00:20:30.950
We've got another mission waiting for us!

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:34.460
Let's go, Yuu-san.

00:20:36.120 --> 00:20:37.460
Yeah.

00:22:10.510 --> 00:22:13.790
Oh, this is where you were.

00:22:16.960 --> 00:22:19.960
The cold shoulder again?

00:22:19.960 --> 00:22:22.250
But I have good news for you.

00:22:22.250 --> 00:22:25.780
You see, I was out checking on things today.

00:22:25.780 --> 00:22:28.270
Things like Hyakuya Yuuichirou-kun.

00:22:30.780 --> 00:22:35.540
I only saw him from afar, but he seemed to be doing well.

00:22:36.360 --> 00:22:40.290
Well, that's enough chitchat.

00:22:40.290 --> 00:22:42.240
Let's be on our way.

00:22:42.240 --> 00:22:46.050
The great war between the vampires
 and humans is about to begin,

00:22:47.010 --> 00:22:50.300
Hyakuya Mikaela-kun.

00:22:56.310 --> 00:22:58.710
Wait for me, Yuu-chan.

00:22:58.710 --> 00:23:02.860
I <i>will</i> take you back.
